================================================================================
Model weights and asset packs (fetched at runtime, not vendored)
================================================================================
Weights are never committed here. The curated rows in
crates/server/src/catalog.json are the authoritative record; the same license
ids are published on GET /v1/capabilities (`licenses`) and stamped into the
job bundle report (`final_00.json`: `model_license`). Curated license ids:

- llama3.2 — Meta Llama 3.2 Community License (bartowski/Llama-3.2-*-Instruct-GGUF).
- llama3.1 — Meta Llama 3.1 Community License (bartowski/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct-GGUF).
- apache-2.0 — Apache License 2.0 (Qwen/Qwen2.5-*, black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell,
  hexgrad/kokoro).
- mit — MIT License (bartowski/Phi-3.5-mini-instruct-GGUF, ggerganov/whisper.cpp,
  rhasspy/piper-voices).
- gemma — Gemma Terms of Use (bartowski/gemma-2-2b-it-GGUF).
- creativeml-openrail-m — CreativeML Open RAIL-M (Comfy-Ori/stable-diffusion-v1-5).
- openrail++ — Stability AI OpenRail++ (stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0).
- CC-BY-NC 4.0, BFL-NC, QAL-1.0, Tencent-community — additional curated
  content-license ids for NC / territory-restricted rows and asset packs;
  the machine-readable row carries the applicable terms URL and restrictions.
  Lowercase spellings (cc-by-nc-4.0, bfl-nc, qal-1.0, tencent-community) refer
  to the same curated rows; the catalog row is authoritative.
  Exact catalog ids: tencent-hunyuan-community, flux-non-commercial-license,
  cc-by-nc-4.0 (territory- and NC-restricted weights).

Per-row terms URL, territory, gating, commercial terms, source URL, published
sha256 and required attribution text live on the catalog record; non-commercial
weights are stamped `non_commercial: true` in the job bundle report. The machine-readable
set on GET /v1/capabilities is always current.
